---
description: Where new pixel art uploads live so Grok can find them
alwaysApply: true
---

New player-generated pixel assets are in `public/assets/uploads/` (see `AGENTS.md` and `public/assets/uploads/README.md`). Scan `inbox/`, `heroes/`, `enemies/`, `items/`, `shop/`, `ui/`, `bg/`, `fx/`, and `INDEX.md`. Do not overwrite vendored Pixel Frog files under `public/assets/heroes` and siblings. Wire new PNGs through `src/game/assets.ts` at `/assets/uploads/...`.
